# REST

## 1. Admin

### 1.1 Login

POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "",
"password": "",
"rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register

POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
"username": "",
"email": "",
"password": "",
"confirmPassword": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password

POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": ""
}

### 1.4 Profile

GET http://localhost:9092/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer ""

## 2. User

### 2.1 Login

POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
"identifier": "",
"password": ""
}

### 2.2 Register

POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
"username": "",
"email": "",
"password": "",
"confirmPassword": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password

POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": ""
}

### 2.4 Profile

GET http://localhost:9092/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer ""
